# Unreal T3D

Deferred. The overlay is dictation only. Do not add a Blueprint mode switch.

If T3D is wired later, serialize node graphs as Unreal **T3D** (`Begin Object` / `End Object`) onto the Windows clipboard. Do not write `.uasset` / `.umap`. Validate against `ue/SAMPLE_PRINT_STRING.t3d`.
